WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.537
Lab 1 runs on a laptop
with Python and no tenant.

2
00:00:03.537 --> 00:00:06.284
Step one lists the reads
and their permissions:

3
00:00:06.284 --> 00:00:11.072
the assignment policies and the assignments
under entitlement management read,

4
00:00:11.072 --> 00:00:13.888
and the transitive
memberships under user read.

5
00:00:13.888 --> 00:00:14.974
Nothing writes.

6
00:00:14.974 --> 00:00:18.189
Step two lints the program's
three policy files,

7
00:00:18.189 --> 00:00:21.650
evaluating each rule over
the fixture population.

8
00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:24.150
Zero findings, zero warnings.

9
00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:27.620
That's the baseline every
new policy file has to keep.
